    * parameters: ('- **Pricing Strategy Implementation**: Targeting the Mid-to-High Artisanal sweet spot (EGP 600 - 850 for large/double-wick jars, EGP 400 - 480 for standard jars, and EGP 200 - 250 for minis/travel tins) using a COGS × 3 pricing multiplier to protect margins.\n- **Product Differentiation Focus**: Highlighting 100% natural, clean-burning soy wax (toxin-free vs. paraffin), strong hot/cold scent throws, and multi-cycle upcycled heat-resistant glass containers for home decor.\n- **Meta Ads Campaign Structure**: \n  - *Budget*: EGP 12,000 to 15,000 for the launch month.\n  - *Phase 1 (Teaser - 35% / EGP 4,500)*: 2-week pre-launch period focusing on Reels, BTS manufacturing, aesthetic mood lighting, and building a waitlist/lead generation for early-bird offers.\n  - *Phase 2 (Launch & Conversion - 65% / EGP 10,500)*: 3-week direct conversion push using Carousel and Video ads highlighting the upcycled glass utility and value proposition against imported brands.\n- **Audience Targeting**: Ages 24–45, urban residents in Cairo, Giza, and Alexandria (New Cairo, 5th Settlement, Sheikh Zayed, 6th of October, Zamalek, Maadi, Smouha), with interests in Home Decor, Interior Design, Soy Candles, Aromatherapy, Wellness, and Sustainable Living.\n- **Growth Vectors**: Planned expansion into B2B hospitality private-label programs (spas and hotels) and quarterly sensory subscription boxes.', {'active_plans': '- **Pricing Strategy Implementation**: Targeting the Mid-to-High Artisanal sweet spot (EGP 600 - 850 for large/double-wick jars, EGP 400 - 480 for standard jars, and EGP 200 - 250 for minis/travel tins) using a COGS × 3 pricing multiplier to protect margins.\n- **Product Differentiation Focus**: Highlighting 100% natural, clean-burning soy wax (toxin-free vs. paraffin), strong hot/cold scent throws, and multi-cycle upcycled heat-resistant glass containers for home decor.\n- **Meta Ads Campaign Structure**: \n  - *Budget*: EGP 12,000 to 15,000 for the launch month.\n  - *Phase 1 (Teaser - 35% / EGP 4,500)*: 2-week pre-launch period focusing on Reels, BTS manufacturing, aesthetic mood lighting, and building a waitlist/lead generation for early-bird offers.\n  - *Phase 2 (Launch & Conversion - 65% / EGP 10,500)*: 3-week direct conversion push using Carousel and Video ads highlighting the upcycled glass utility and value proposition against imported brands.\n- **Audience Targeting**: Ages 24–45, urban residents in Cairo, Giza, and Alexandria (New Cairo, 5th Settlement, Sheikh Zayed, 6th of October, Zamalek, Maadi, Smouha), with interests in Home Decor, Interior Design, Soy Candles, Aromatherapy, Wellness, and Sustainable Living.\n- **Growth Vectors**: Planned expansion into B2B hospitality private-label programs (spas and hotels) and quarterly sensory subscription boxes.', 'source': 'ltm_compressor', 'created_at': '2026-10-11T20:11:09.435131+00:00', 'updated_at': '2026-10-12T10:27:25.842644+00:00'}, 'mem_plan_ba3c879d057b')
