    * parameters: ('- **Market Gap Opportunities & Strategies:**\n  - **Pricing:** Targeted the untapped Mid-to-High Artisanal tier (EGP 600 - 850) as the primary sweet spot.\n  - **Sustainability:** Leveraged multi-cycle upcycled heat-resistant glass containers as a unique product differentiator.\n  - **Scent Architecture:** Proposed sophisticated regional and botanical-infused scent profiles to avoid generic market replication.\n  - **Growth Vectors:** Highlighted B2B hospitality, boutique spa private-label programs, and quarterly sensory subscription boxes for structural growth.\n  - **Competitors Referenced:** Bubblzz, LOCKEN, Pia Scents.\n\n- **Advertising Strategy & Launch Plan:**\n  - **Goal:** Brand awareness, lead generation, and waitlist building in major Egyptian cities (Cairo, Giza, Alexandria - New Cairo, Zamalek, Zayed, October, Smouha, Roushdy) before/during launch.\n  - **Target Audience:** Age 24-45, interested in home decor, interior design, soy candles, aromatherapy, wellness, self-care, sustainable living (excluding under-23s).\n  - **Ad Angles:** \n    1. Clean-burning / Health (100% soy wax, cotton wicks).\n    2. Sustainability / Decor (Upcycled multi-cycle heat-resistant glass containers).\n    3. Affordable Luxury (Mid-to-High EGP 600-850 sweet spot).\n  - **Funnel Phases & Copy:** \n    1. Teaser Phase (35% budget / ~4,500 EGP, 2 weeks of Reels/Stories, BTS, waitlist/pre-launch offers with Egyptian Conversational copy).\n    2. Launch Phase (65% budget / ~10,500 EGP, 3 weeks of Carousel & Video ads showing burn mood, upcycled reuse, and launch/shipping offers).\n    3. Retargeting (Social proof, value comparison).\n  - **Visuals:** Mood lighting, night burn videos with calm audio on Reels. Visual identity and premium label design must match the pricing tier.\n\n- **Budget Allocation & Proposed Investment (EGP):**\n  - **Recommended Sweet Spot Plan:** Balanced Growth Plan (12,000 - 15,000 EGP total: ~4,500 EGP teaser / ~10,500 EGP launch) targeting Cairo, Giza & Alexandria. Expected reach: 120k-180k, high engagement, optimized for the EGP 600-850 pricing tier.\n  - **ROI Tips:** Prioritize Reels/video content, laser-focused interest targeting, and maintain fast DM/Inbox response times to convert high-intent buyers.\n\n- **Brand Analysis:**\n  - **Positioning:** Mid-to-High Artisanal tier (EGP 600-850), filling the gap between cheap commercial candles (<EGP 350) and ultra-luxury/imported brands (>EGP 950).\n  - **USPs:** 100% natural soy wax, cotton wicks, multi-cycle upcycled heat-resistant glass containers for home decor, and bespoke regional/botanical scent architectures.', 'conv_888b9b662f8d4bbebf5f')
