    * parameters: ('- Brand Name: Unnamed (Planning stage / Name selection phase)\n- Industry/Sector: Scented and Decorative Candles / Home Fragrance (Focused on clean-burning soy wax, classical cotton wicks, and heavy-duty, heat-resistant glass containers engineered for multi-cycle home decor upcycling)\n- Geography/Country: Egypt (with primary urban fulfillment and target zones including Cairo, Giza, and Alexandria, specifically targeting high-end residential hubs like New Cairo, 5th Settlement, Sheikh Zayed, 6th of October, Maadi, Zamalek, and Smouha)\n- Target Audience: Urban home decor enthusiasts, fragrance lovers, wellness seekers, and health-conscious consumers desiring attainable luxury, emotional wellness, sensory escapism, mental restoration, and pride in local artisanal craftsmanship (Ages 24-45)\n- Pricing Policy & Architecture: Structured market tiers:\n  - Entry-level/Mass: EGP 300 to 350\n  - Lower-Middle Tier: EGP 382 to 590 (Bubblzz, LOCKEN, Aromatica)\n  - Mid-to-High Artisanal Sweet Spot (Target Tier): EGP 600 to 850 (Bridging basic indie alternatives and luxury pricing)\n  - Luxury: Up to EGP 950+ (Pia Scents) to EGP 1,200 - 1,400+ (Bath & Body Works 3-Wick)\n- Known Competitors & Market Players: Bath & Body Works, Source Beauty, Pia Scents, Bubblzz, Areej Aromatherapy, Flamingo, Splendour, LOCKEN, and Aromatica', UUID('bd10c9c7-9809-4016-954c-d0bc434fc638'))
